{"4292250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lastlore Saga", "steam_appid": 4292250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/76e23f537175b42838c0e2eff60ce016.avif?t=1785407460\" width=1024 height=209 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand-crafted pixel art brings a classic RPG world to life, featuring unique characters,  nostalgic combat, with roguelike progression. Beneath the retro look lies a modern roguelike core: procedurally driven encounters, evolving challenges, and constant variation ensure that every run feels fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/7b232fff83b54a1d493a9fa097b33654.poster.avif?t=1785407460\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/7b232fff83b54a1d493a9fa097b33654.webm?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/7b232fff83b54a1d493a9fa097b33654.mp4?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👥 Unique Characters &amp; Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the legendary RPGs of the 16-bit era, the game features turn-based tactical combat, party-based strategy, and character-driven gameplay. Assemble a balanced team, customize your loadout, and master synergistic abilities to overcome powerful enemies, all while enjoying the familiar feel of a classic JRPG, reimagined for roguelike progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/92b0ed3bd1fd3ab661992cd85deb2e7b.poster.avif?t=1785407460\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/92b0ed3bd1fd3ab661992cd85deb2e7b.webm?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/92b0ed3bd1fd3ab661992cd85deb2e7b.mp4?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roguelike pathing so each playthrough feels new and fresh!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is shaped by the choices you make. Select branching routes, face unique encounters, and decide how much risk you’re willing to take. Will you push forward for greater rewards, or play it safe to protect your party? Each path offers different battles, events, and opportunities that can drastically alter your run.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/76e23f537175b42838c0e2eff60ce016.avif?t=1785407460\" width=1024 height=209 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand-crafted pixel art brings a classic RPG world to life, featuring unique characters,  nostalgic combat, with roguelike progression. Beneath the retro look lies a modern roguelike core: procedurally driven encounters, evolving challenges, and constant variation ensure that every run feels fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/7b232fff83b54a1d493a9fa097b33654.poster.avif?t=1785407460\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/7b232fff83b54a1d493a9fa097b33654.webm?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/7b232fff83b54a1d493a9fa097b33654.mp4?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👥 Unique Characters &amp; Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the legendary RPGs of the 16-bit era, the game features turn-based tactical combat, party-based strategy, and character-driven gameplay. Assemble a balanced team, customize your loadout, and master synergistic abilities to overcome powerful enemies, all while enjoying the familiar feel of a classic JRPG, reimagined for roguelike progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/92b0ed3bd1fd3ab661992cd85deb2e7b.poster.avif?t=1785407460\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/92b0ed3bd1fd3ab661992cd85deb2e7b.webm?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292250/extras/92b0ed3bd1fd3ab661992cd85deb2e7b.mp4?t=1785407460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roguelike pathing so each playthrough feels new and fresh!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is shaped by the choices you make. Select branching routes, face unique encounters, and decide how much risk you’re willing to take. Will you push forward for greater rewards, or play it safe to protect your party? Each path offers different battles, events, and opportunities th